\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Don't use heavy drop shadows for card elevation \'97 the system relies on 1px borders, not depth, to define containers\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't use pure black (#000000) for body text \'97 use #171717 or #0a0a0a for slightly softer contrast\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't apply the Electric Blue (#2563eb) to large background fills \'97 it's a highlight color, not a surface color\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't use multiple chromatic colors on a single component \'97 each pill or feature tag gets exactly one accent\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't use Satoshi at body sizes \'97 Satoshi is display-only (36px+); Inter handles everything below 30px\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't use radii outside the defined vocabulary (9999px, 16px, 12px, 8px, 6px) \'97 ad-hoc rounding breaks the system's rhythm\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Don't use color for decorative gradients on UI elements \'97 the conic spectrum gradient is reserved for the logo and brand visuals only
